    <item>
      <title>从分钟到毫秒：CrateDB如何重塑AI时代的数据基础设施与智能未来</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/cratedbai-20250904171004850-3/</link>
      <pubDate>Thu, 04 Sep 2025 17:10:04 +0800</pubDate>
